<header class="ref-head"><span class="hero-ornament"></span><h1 class="research-title">12 April in history</h1><p class="ref-lede">7 events that happened on 12 April, from 467 to 1961.</p></header>
<ol class="day-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">467 CE <span class="tih-ago">1,559 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Anthemius is proclaimed Western Roman emperor</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Backed by the eastern emperor Leo I, Anthemius was raised to the western throne near Rome. A joint expedition against the Vandals failed, and he was killed in 472.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vandals">Vandals</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb tih-event-hero"><p class="tih-hero-kicker">&#10022; Anniversary of the day</p><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/fourth-crusade" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/fourth-crusade.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1204 CE <span class="tih-ago">822 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Fourth Crusade storms Constantinople</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Crusaders and Venetians broke into Constantinople and began three days of pillage. They set up a Latin Empire, and Byzantium never recovered its former strength.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag tih-tag-profile" href="/empire/byzantine-empire">Byzantine Empire</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/fourth-crusade">Fourth Crusade</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1606 CE <span class="tih-ago">420 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">First Union Flag is adopted for English and Scottish ships</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">A royal proclamation of James I ordered ships of England and Scotland to fly a new flag combining the crosses of St George and St Andrew. St Patrick's saltire was added in 1801.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/scotland">Scotland</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/england">England</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1861 CE <span class="tih-ago">165 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Confederate guns open fire on Fort Sumter</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Confederate batteries bombarded the federal fort in Charleston harbour, forcing its surrender the next day. The attack began the American Civil War.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1945 CE <span class="tih-ago">81 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Franklin D. Roosevelt dies at Warm Springs</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Franklin D. Roosevelt died of a cerebral haemorrhage in Georgia early in his fourth term. Harry Truman became president and presided over the end of the war in Europe and the Pacific.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/georgia">Georgia</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1955 CE <span class="tih-ago">71 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Salk's polio vaccine is declared safe and effective</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Results of a nationwide trial involving more than a million children showed Jonas Salk's vaccine worked. Mass vaccination soon cut polio cases dramatically.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">1961 CE <span class="tih-ago">65 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Yuri Gagarin becomes the first human in space</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Soviet cosmonaut Yuri Gagarin orbited the Earth once aboard Vostok 1 in a flight of 108 minutes. The achievement gave the Soviet Union a major lead in the space race.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/soviet-union">Soviet Union</a></div></div></li></ol>
